00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:28,930
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:29,958 --> 00:00:30,916
Tear a piece off.

2
00:00:30,916 --> 00:00:33,250
- Tear a piece off.
- There.

3
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:35,250
- Give it to me.
- Here, you eat it.

4
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:36,550
Here.

5
00:00:37,416 --> 00:00:38,841
You eat it.

6
00:00:48,989 --> 00:00:50,000
Here, bro.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,500
You eat it. I'm not hungry.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,083
Uh...

9
00:00:54,083 --> 00:00:55,125
Well...

10
00:00:55,125 --> 00:00:57,341
That... That's too kind of you.

11
00:00:57,958 --> 00:00:59,000
It's all ours.

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,133
We'll save it for tomorrow.

13
00:01:34,607 --> 00:01:36,324
Is the fuel line fixed?

14
00:01:39,461 --> 00:01:40,542
No.

15
00:01:40,542 --> 00:01:42,676
I'm tired. I'm going to sleep.

16
00:02:10,383 --> 00:02:11,808
Lin Zai.

17
00:02:13,625 --> 00:02:15,050
Lin Zai.

18
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:24,675
Lin Zai.

19
00:02:35,875 --> 00:02:37,258
Lin Zai.

20
00:04:12,661 --> 00:04:17,176
[Apocalypse Log 8]

21
00:04:33,708 --> 00:04:35,800
I'm going to look for more diesel.

22
00:05:28,125 --> 00:05:29,875
This sleeve...

23
00:05:29,875 --> 00:05:32,208
How did it get torn?

24
00:05:32,208 --> 00:05:33,882
I must have snagged it somewhere.

25
00:05:33,882 --> 00:05:35,298
It's fine.

26
00:05:35,298 --> 00:05:36,632
How can it be fine?

27
00:05:36,632 --> 00:05:38,548
Come, let me stitch it up for you.

28
00:05:38,548 --> 00:05:40,215
It's fine, madam. Really.

29
00:05:40,215 --> 00:05:41,882
It'll be quick.

30
00:05:41,882 --> 00:05:44,098
You silly child.

31
00:05:45,007 --> 00:05:46,715
If your family were here,

32
00:05:46,715 --> 00:05:48,215
and saw you running around

33
00:05:48,215 --> 00:05:49,423
in these torn clothes,

34
00:05:49,423 --> 00:05:52,590
they would feel so heartbroken.

35
00:05:52,590 --> 00:05:54,382
If I were your mother,

36
00:05:54,382 --> 00:05:56,340
just thinking about you out there,

37
00:05:56,340 --> 00:05:59,173
not eating or dressing well,

38
00:05:59,173 --> 00:06:01,298
with no one to look after you...

39
00:06:01,298 --> 00:06:05,265
It would feel like
countless needles pricking my heart.

40
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:10,757
In this world, nothing is more important

41
00:06:10,757 --> 00:06:12,598
than your own safety.

42
00:06:13,382 --> 00:06:14,798
You have to take care of yourself.

43
00:06:14,798 --> 00:06:16,390
Do you understand?

44
00:06:22,090 --> 00:06:23,465
Look.

45
00:06:23,465 --> 00:06:24,890
It's all sewn up.

46
00:06:31,292 --> 00:06:33,009
Is the boat fixed?

47
00:06:34,423 --> 00:06:37,140
Is the boat being fixed all you care about now?

48
00:06:38,965 --> 00:06:40,973
We have to leave as soon as possible.

49
00:06:42,423 --> 00:06:44,223
Leave as soon as possible...

50
00:06:45,423 --> 00:06:46,965
And then what?

51
00:06:46,965 --> 00:06:48,465
Is there anything else on your mind right now

52
00:06:48,465 --> 00:06:49,507
besides your damn mission?

53
00:06:49,507 --> 00:06:50,723
There is.

54
00:06:58,507 --> 00:07:02,140
Getting to HQ as soon as possible
is best for everyone.

55
00:07:06,507 --> 00:07:08,057
Everyone?

56
00:07:09,048 --> 00:07:11,890
So, you still see me as just an immune, huh?

57
00:07:13,132 --> 00:07:14,423
If I weren't an immune,

58
00:07:14,423 --> 00:07:16,382
you'd just leave me to die, right?

59
00:07:16,382 --> 00:07:17,682
I...

60
00:07:22,632 --> 00:07:24,007
Fine.

61
00:07:24,007 --> 00:07:25,715
Very well.

62
00:07:25,715 --> 00:07:27,265
I get it.

63
00:08:17,715 --> 00:08:19,390
We just need some fuel.

64
00:08:43,257 --> 00:08:44,598
Madam.

65
00:08:46,048 --> 00:08:49,098
Do you know where the nearest town is?

66
00:08:50,215 --> 00:08:52,890
There's one five kilometers east.

67
00:08:53,548 --> 00:08:55,098
What's wrong?

68
00:08:57,465 --> 00:08:59,423
Are you not feeling well?

69
00:08:59,423 --> 00:09:00,548
No.

70
00:09:00,548 --> 00:09:01,965
Isn't your son injured?

71
00:09:01,965 --> 00:09:04,848
I was wondering where to get supplies
if we ran out of medicine.

72
00:09:06,364 --> 00:09:08,598
You're so kind.

73
00:09:57,132 --> 00:09:58,515
Hey.

74
00:09:59,132 --> 00:10:00,840
Hey, what's wrong?

75
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,090
Hey!

76
00:10:02,090 --> 00:10:04,048
Someone, help!

77
00:10:04,048 --> 00:10:05,807
What's wrong with you?

78
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,841
What happened to him?

79
00:10:12,841 --> 00:10:14,673
I...

80
00:10:14,673 --> 00:10:16,173
He just ate a little of that.

81
00:10:16,173 --> 00:10:18,007
I gathered some wild herbs and fruits

82
00:10:18,007 --> 00:10:19,640
and mashed them into a paste.

83
00:10:21,173 --> 00:10:23,507
He's allergic to this.

84
00:10:23,507 --> 00:10:25,890
How... How is that possible?

85
00:10:43,923 --> 00:10:45,473
Where's the medicine?

86
00:10:47,257 --> 00:10:50,640
I wouldn't dare touch your things.

87
00:10:51,798 --> 00:10:52,798
Right.

88
00:10:52,798 --> 00:10:54,673
There should be medicine in town.

89
00:10:54,673 --> 00:10:56,723
Five kilometers to the east.

90
00:11:03,750 --> 00:11:05,632
You should leave him here.

91
00:11:05,632 --> 00:11:08,423
We'll help you look after him.

92
00:11:08,423 --> 00:11:11,173
There are zombies in town.

93
00:11:11,173 --> 00:11:12,882
It's not convenient to carry him.

94
00:11:12,882 --> 00:11:14,340
We'll watch over him for you.

95
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,265
Go and come back quickly.

96
00:11:32,007 --> 00:11:33,465
Watch him.

97
00:11:33,465 --> 00:11:36,265
Give him plenty of water
and keep his airway clear.

98
00:11:37,048 --> 00:11:39,423
When I get back,

99
00:11:39,423 --> 00:11:42,215
if even a single hair
on his head is missing...

100
00:11:42,215 --> 00:11:43,507
Don't worry.

101
00:11:43,507 --> 00:11:46,215
We'll definitely take good care of him.

102
00:11:46,215 --> 00:11:48,140
Come back soon.

103
00:12:10,298 --> 00:12:12,965
This is a real godsend.

104
00:12:12,965 --> 00:12:14,715
Go and get ready.

105
00:12:14,715 --> 00:12:17,507
When that kid comes back,
we'll catch him off guard.

106
00:12:17,507 --> 00:12:19,173
Mom, go back inside.

107
00:12:19,173 --> 00:12:20,411
Keep a close eye on that one.

108
00:12:20,411 --> 00:12:21,590
Don't let anything go wrong.

109
00:12:21,590 --> 00:12:22,798
I know.

110
00:12:22,798 --> 00:12:24,098
Go.

111
00:12:34,340 --> 00:12:37,473
You... You're awake.

112
00:12:38,173 --> 00:12:39,714
Thanks. I'll be going now.

113
00:12:39,714 --> 00:12:40,716
That won't do.

114
00:12:40,716 --> 00:12:43,173
That young man told us to watch over you.

115
00:12:43,173 --> 00:12:44,840
I'm really fine now. I'm leaving.

116
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,547
If you leave, what are we supposed to do?

117
00:12:46,547 --> 00:12:47,632
When that young man returns,

118
00:12:47,632 --> 00:12:49,257
he'll kill us if he doesn't see you.

119
00:12:49,257 --> 00:12:51,640
He's not the type to kill innocents.

120
00:12:52,882 --> 00:12:55,140
Quick! Stop him!

121
00:14:15,798 --> 00:14:17,348
Meat.

122
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:19,890
Eat meat.

123
00:14:24,423 --> 00:14:27,673
My poor child.

124
00:14:27,673 --> 00:14:30,423
It's your mother's fault.

125
00:14:30,423 --> 00:14:31,673
Since you were little,

126
00:14:31,673 --> 00:14:34,890
I haven't been able to give you much meat.

127
00:14:35,548 --> 00:14:38,598
I've failed you.

128
00:14:39,257 --> 00:14:40,257
Mom.

129
00:14:40,257 --> 00:14:42,298
Don't keep saying that.

130
00:14:42,298 --> 00:14:45,173
Didn't a tender one just arrive?

131
00:14:45,173 --> 00:14:47,765
How should we handle this one?

132
00:14:59,507 --> 00:15:02,882
For Cheng Cai, take a thigh.

133
00:15:02,882 --> 00:15:04,007
And the ribs.

134
00:15:04,007 --> 00:15:05,173
Chop them off.

135
00:15:05,173 --> 00:15:07,173
Make some rib soup.

136
00:15:07,173 --> 00:15:10,132
As for the rest, marinate it.

137
00:15:10,132 --> 00:15:12,598
It'll last us for a while.

138
00:15:14,757 --> 00:15:16,548
Cheng Cai.

139
00:15:16,548 --> 00:15:17,667
It's about time.

140
00:15:17,667 --> 00:15:19,759
Go lie in wait for the other one.

141
00:15:22,090 --> 00:15:23,757
Be careful.

142
00:15:23,757 --> 00:15:25,598
That one is tough.

143
00:15:29,757 --> 00:15:31,215
Meat.

144
00:15:31,215 --> 00:15:32,465
Meat.

145
00:15:32,465 --> 00:15:34,640
- Meat.
- Be careful.

146
00:15:36,423 --> 00:15:38,132
Cheng Ren.

147
00:15:38,132 --> 00:15:41,140
Go and get that kid.

148
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,842
Let go of me!

149
00:17:33,548 --> 00:17:35,215
Son!

150
00:17:35,215 --> 00:17:36,298
Son!

151
00:17:36,298 --> 00:17:38,173
Son! Let go of my son!

152
00:17:38,173 --> 00:17:39,465
Let go of my son!

153
00:17:39,465 --> 00:17:43,015
Let go of my son!

154
00:17:51,298 --> 00:17:53,473
No one can hurt my son!

155
00:18:00,507 --> 00:18:01,890
Mom.

156
00:18:02,673 --> 00:18:04,298
Mom!

157
00:18:04,298 --> 00:18:05,682
Mom!

158
00:18:07,673 --> 00:18:09,007
Mom!

159
00:18:09,007 --> 00:18:10,507
Mom.

160
00:18:10,507 --> 00:18:11,882
Mom.

161
00:18:11,882 --> 00:18:13,840
Mom.

162
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:15,723
Mom.

163
00:18:16,382 --> 00:18:18,390
Mom.

164
00:18:53,541 --> 00:18:54,590
Don't.

165
00:18:54,590 --> 00:18:55,673
Don't kill me.

166
00:18:55,673 --> 00:18:57,348
I'm a human being.

167
00:19:14,917 --> 00:19:16,342
Lin Zai.

